  "remediation_note": "The record requires incorporation of the Agency's investigative findings, the evidence examined to reach each material conclusion, and explicit reasoning linking evidence to the determination that complainant failed to prove discrimination. Specifically, articulate what was investigated regarding causation, temporal proximity, qualifications, and comparator analysis.",
  "finding": {
    "ai_function": "summarization",
    "condition_triggered": "reasoning_traceability, accountability_support, cold_reviewer_clarity",
    "compliant_version": "A compliant record would include a substantive investigation findings section documenting: (1) the evidence obtained regarding each selection decision (panel composition, scoring, interview notes, qualifications compared to selected candidates); (2) the temporal analysis between the March 2022 protected activity and May 2022 adverse actions; (3) comparator analysis addressing whether similarly-situated individuals outside the protected class received more favorable treatment; (4) specific findings on each element of the discrimination claim; and (5) explicit reasoning connecting the evidence to the conclusion that discrimination was not proven, including what would have been required to meet the burden."
  }
}
